    <string name="welcome_note_title">Welcome to Mis Notas</string>
    <string name="welcome_note_body">This note is a short tour of the app. Edit it, practice with it, or delete it whenever you like.\n\n## The basics\n- Tap **+** to create a note.\n- Notes open in **reading mode**: tap ✏️ to edit.\n- Long-press a note to **select several** and move, pin, color or delete them.\n- Long-press a folder and drag it to put it inside another one.\n- Deleted notes go to the **trash**, where they are kept for %1$d days.\n\n## Formatting\nWrite in Markdown or use the editor toolbar: **bold**, *italic*, ~~strikethrough~~ and `code`.\n\n&gt; Quotes start with “&gt;”.\n\n## Checklists\n- [x] Open Mis Notas\n- [ ] Tick this box (tap it in reading mode)\n- [ ] Create your first folder\n\n## Keep your notes safe\n- Without an account, everything is stored **only on this device**.\n- In **Settings** you can turn on a daily automatic backup to a folder of your choice.\n- If you connect **Nextcloud**, notes are encrypted on your phone before they are uploaded. Keep your master password safe: **if you forget it, nobody can recover your notes**.</string>
